  "content": {
    "id": "p26-q13",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "13",
    "prompt": "A person's heart beats at an average rate of 70 beats per minute. Use 365 days in a year.",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p26-q13-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "How many times will a heart beat in a lifetime of 80 years?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$2\\,943\\,360\\,000$ beats",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{70\\text{ beats}}{1\\text{ min}}&=\\frac{70\\text{ beats}}{(1\\div60\\div24\\div365)\\text{ year}}\\\\\\frac{70\\text{ beats}}{1\\text{ min}}&=\\frac{36\\,792\\,000\\text{ beats}}{1\\text{ year}}\\\\\\frac{36\\,792\\,000\\text{ beats}}{1\\text{ year}}&=\\frac{x\\text{ beats}}{80\\text{ years}}\\\\x&=36\\,792\\,000\\times80\\\\x&=2\\,943\\,360\\,000\\text{ beats}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 62
      },
      {
        "id": "p26-q13-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "How long will it take for a heart to beat 1 million times? Give your answer in days, to 1 decimal place.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$9.9$ days",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{70\\text{ beats}}{1\\text{ min}}&=\\frac{1\\,000\\,000\\text{ beats}}{x\\text{ min}}\\end{align*}$$\nTake the reciprocal of both sides.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{1\\text{ min}}{70\\text{ beats}}&=\\frac{x\\text{ min}}{1\\,000\\,000\\text{ beats}}\\\\x&=\\frac{1\\,000\\,000}{70}\\text{ min}\\\\x&=\\frac{100\\,000}{7}\\text{ min}\\\\x&=\\frac{100\\,000}{7\\times60}\\text{ h}\\\\x&=\\frac{100\\,000}{7\\times60\\times24}\\text{ days}\\\\x&\\approx9.9\\text{ days}\\end{align*}$$\nThe intermediate times are approximately $14\\,285.7$ min and $238.1$ h; the calculation uses unrounded values.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 76
      }
    ]
  },
